\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {2}{\ignorespaces  Overview R2OMC: Distractors are automatically filtered out and proposal distributions $q_i^n$ are created for each observation (here two): the blue-dotted region indicates where the proposal distributions for the first observation are nonzero, and the green-dotted region indicates the same for the second observation. Only samples that fall within the intersection of both regions are given a positive weight and become posterior samples.}}{5}{figure.caption.5}\protected@file@percent }
